- Buried? No.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.518 align:start size:63% position:38%
I haven't, actually.
It's funny, that.

00:03:39.551 --> 00:03:41.520 align:start position:0%
So, your job is to go out
to the middle

00:03:41.553 --> 00:03:43.589 size:78% position:39%
and disperse them nicely.

00:03:43.622 --> 00:03:46.859 align:start size:41% position:59%
