Gav:<i> It's just
 raining ducks, yeah.</i>

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:52.051
Dan:<i> That was class.</i>

00:05:52.084 --> 00:05:54.653 align:start position:0%
And I think Steven was the one
who went the highest, so--

00:05:54.686 --> 00:05:56.122 align:start size:84% position:16%
