- No.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.857
- Can we get-- no?
- Don't think we can.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:01.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
- How do you feel, right...
- Yeah?

00:06:01.693 --> 00:06:05.664 align:start size:81% position:19%
- about taking it
  right in the face?
- Okay, all right.

00:06:05.697 --> 00:06:08.134 align:start size:63% position:38%
I knew it was 
a matter of time
before you asked me.

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:09.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
