- Yeah. Yeah, obviously.

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:12.671 size:84% position:58%
Um, I'd say not full beans.

00:06:12.704 --> 00:06:15.141 align:start size:78% position:22%
- So, half beans?
- Yeah.

00:06:15.174 --> 00:06:16.776
- Medium beans?
- Medium beans.

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:18.511 align:start size:69% position:31%
All right.
We can deal with that.

00:06:18.544 --> 00:06:20.679 align:start size:91% position:9%
- Okay.
- All right, well, let's--

00:06:20.712 --> 00:06:21.680 align:start size:59% position:41%
let's move
the old gantry over

00:06:21.713 --> 00:06:23.516
and lean over the edge of it.

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:24.850 align:start size:31% position:69%
Brilliant.

00:06:24.883 --> 00:06:26.719 align:start position:0%
Okay, I'm ready!

00:06:28.053 --> 00:06:29.688 align:start size:66% position:34%
Dan, are you nervous?

