but we will get wet.

00:08:01.813 --> 00:08:04.250 align:start position:0%
And hopefully we won't
break the camera as well.

00:08:04.283 --> 00:08:05.951 align:start position:0%
Let me know when
it's gonna come,

00:08:05.984 --> 00:08:07.853 align:start position:0%
cause I don't-- I can't
really see anything.

00:08:07.886 --> 00:08:10.990 align:start position:0%
Now it is. Here we go.

00:08:15.994 --> 00:08:17.796
Both: Whoa!

00:08:17.829 --> 00:08:19.832 align:start size:41% position:59%
Whoa.

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:26.805
Gav:
<i> That looks so weird.</i>

00:08:26.838 --> 00:08:28.974
<i> Because it's looking
