 it's warping space.</i>

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.646 align:start size:91% position:9%
- Dan:<i> Yeah. </i>
- Gav:<i> That's really good.</i>

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:36.148
 Dan:<i> It was like someone
 just took a bucket</i>

00:08:36.181 --> 00:08:38.817
<i> and went, like, up my nose.
 Just like, "Ahh." </i>

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:39.985
Gav:<i> That's exactly
 what it looked like.</i>

00:08:40.018 --> 00:08:42.821
Dan:
<i> Straight up my nose.</i>

00:08:42.854 --> 00:08:44.990
<i> ( chuckling )</i>

00:08:45.023 --> 00:08:47.660
<i> Took it to the grid.
 Right in the grid hole.</i>

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:49.695
Gav:<i> Didn't even need
 the bag, after all that.</i>

00:08:59.338 --> 00:09:02.308
