00:09:02.341 --> 00:09:04.009 align:start size:16% position:84%
Yeah.

00:09:04.042 --> 00:09:07.046
- ( air whooshing )
- ( both shouting )

00:09:10.048 --> 00:09:12.685 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Jeez.
- The automatic airbag
  went off.

00:09:12.718 --> 00:09:14.219
Oh, my God.

00:09:14.252 --> 00:09:16.322 align:start size:84% position:16%
Well, Dan,
that was some very surreal,

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:18.324 align:start size:69% position:31%
but very satisfying
slow-mo footage.

00:09:18.357 --> 00:09:20.192 align:start size:59% position:41%
It was.
It was a varied day
for me as well.

00:09:20.225 --> 00:09:21.860 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Very fun.
- Yeah, not your typical day.

00:09:21.893 --> 00:09:23.162 align:start size:75% position:25%
